{"id":"49ad0501f11b0cd1","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-random-variable.md","title":"Random Variable","display":"df-random-variable — Random Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-random-variable","aliases":["58-df-random-variable","Random Variable","RV","58-df-zfc-measure8-random-variable"],"display":"df-random-variable — Random Variable","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-random-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-random-variable</span><span>Random Variable</span><span>RV</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-random-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-random-variable — Random Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md\">../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E\\in V\">\\(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E\\in V\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S\\)</span> (measurable-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md\">../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S\\)</span> (random-variable predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}random\\text{-}variable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(E,\\mathcal E))\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(E,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\Omega,E)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal E\\;(X^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal F)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}random\\text{-}variable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(E,\\mathcal E))\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(E,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\Omega,E)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal E\\;(X^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal F)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Random variable: measurable function from sample space to state space</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L^0\">\\(\\mathcal L^0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L^p\">\\(\\mathcal L^p\\)</span> 与旧命名别名是后续构造，不再作为同一 definition 的附加断言。</li>\n<li>Distribution: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_X(B) = \\mathbb{P}(X^{-1}(B))\">\\(\\mu_X(B) = \\mathbb{P}(X^{-1}(B))\\)</span></li>\n<li>Expectation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}[X] = \\int_\\Omega X\\,d\\mathbb{P}\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X] = \\int_\\Omega X\\,d\\mathbb{P}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Conditional expectation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}[X|\\mathcal{G}]\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X|\\mathcal{G}]\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Williams, Probability with Martingales</li>\n<li>Billingsley, Probability and Measure</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S$ (measurable-space predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}random\\text{-}variable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(E,\\mathcal E))\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(E,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\Omega,E)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal E\\;(X^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal F)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal L^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L^p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_X(B) = \\mathbb{P}(X^{-1}(B))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}[X] = \\int_\\Omega X\\,d\\mathbb{P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}[X|\\mathcal{G}]","display":false}],"bytes":1529,"backlinks":[{"id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-random-variable.md]])"},{"id":"c96eb70b5fd08810","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"64b5bf078722d744","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"084076b1e347ab30","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))$ (see [[58-df-random-variable]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1034","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-random-variable.md|58-df-random-variable]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["7f96c502a4a99a46","36d7463d215be751"]}